{"type":"text","text":" keeps the lists it verified across launches: a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"launch then asks each list’s server whether the list it kept is"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"current, a "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"304 Not Modified"},{"type":"text","text":" rather than the list, and never uses"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"one the server hasn’t confirmed. The lists are authenticated with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"a key the library makes and keeps in the Keychain, so one anyone","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"else wrote to the directory is dropped. Nil, the default, keeps","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"them in "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"oid4vcwallet-status-lists"},{"type":"text","text":" in the app’s Caches directory,"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"with complete file protection, or in memory only when that key"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"can’t be had or the directory made, and on macOS; an absolute"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"path, the app’s own, keeps them there, with the protection the","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"app gives it; empty keeps them in memory only. The directory shows","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"whoever can read it which status lists the wallet checks (their"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"URIs, so the issuers of its credentials, not which entries), the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"lists themselves, and when each was last checked. Under complete"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"protection, a check while the device is locked reads and keeps no"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"list there: it downloads instead."}],"url":"\/documentation\/oid4vcwallet\/walletconfiguration\/statuscachedir","kind":"symbol","fr